{
  "info": {
    "name": "Koneksi Jasa - Web API Collection",
    "description": "API Collection untuk aplikasi Koneksi Jasa - Platform Jasa Cuci Mobil & Service AC\n\n## Fitur:\n- Authentication (Login, Register, Logout)\n- Dashboard\n- Service Providers (User view, Admin CRUD)\n- Categories (User view, Admin CRUD)\n- Bookings (User create/cancel, Admin manage)\n- Role-based access control (User/Admin)\n\n## Base URL:\nhttp://localhost:8000\n\n## Authentication:\n- Session-based authentication untuk web routes\n- CSRF token required untuk POST/PUT/DELETE requests\n\n## Notes:\n- Default user login: admin@koneksi-jasa.com / password (role: admin)\n- UUID digunakan sebagai identifier untuk resource (service-providers, categories)\n- Booking ID digunakan untuk booking routes\n\n## User Roles:\n- **user**: Dapat melihat data, membuat booking, melihat booking sendiri\n- **admin**: Full access, CRUD service-providers/categories, manage semua bookings",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "csrf_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "service_provider_uuid",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "category_uuid",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "booking_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          ""
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Public Pages",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Home / Landing Page",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "Halaman utama yang menampilkan service providers dan categories (Public access)"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Show Login Form",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Menampilkan halaman login (Guest only)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Requested-With",
                "value": "XMLHttpRequest"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "email",
                  "value": "admin@koneksi-jasa.com",
                  "description": "Email terdaftar"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "password",
                  "description": "Password minimal 6 karakter"
                },
                {
                  "key": "remember",
                  "value": "true",
                  "description": "Remember me (optional)",
                  "type": "checkbox"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            },
            "description": "Login dengan email dan password. Redirect ke dashboard setelah sukses."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Show Register Form",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["register"]
            },
            "description": "Menampilkan halaman registrasi (Guest only)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Requested-With",
                "value": "XMLHttpRequest"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "name",
                  "value": "John Doe",
                  "description": "Nama lengkap (max 255 karakter)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "email",
                  "value": "john@example.com",
                  "description": "Email valid dan unique"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "password123",
                  "description": "Password minimal 6 karakter"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password_confirmation",
                  "value": "password123",
                  "description": "Konfirmasi password harus sama"
                }
              ]
